**/.thunder/conversations/
**/.thunder/scratchpad/
**/.thunder/bridge/
**/.thunder/tmp/
**/.thunder/*.local.json
**/.thunder/THUNDER.local.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime
runs/
.thunder_test.log

# Test / probe artifacts (run logs, scratch probes)
*.log
.tmp_*/
